#38100
The Ranger's Guild of Samsera~
The Ranger's Guild fo Samsera lies in the south-west quarter of the town's Guild Way
Features of the guild include:
A forest type set up.
A Idea Board
A challenge Board
A Armory of sorts
A shortcut to the proving grounds.
A shopkeep
A Guildmaster
A Challenge Board

The Challenge for Forest Guardian shall be in three parts:
Archery. The first to miss the target.
Hunting. The first to retrieve/hunt a specific animal/object.
Combat. A one on one combat in the proving grounds.

Kurse, Sep 00'
~
