#38101
The tunneled path~
   The path from the gate winds and twists here, passing under business row and
other streets via a series of tunnels lush with vegetation.  You notice on the
walls of some of the tunnels are carved names of legendary Rangers which have
roamed the lands.  On a face of rock near the clearing is a 'map' showing the
orientation of the Forest Guild.    
~
