#38102
The Ring of Trees~
   You step into a large clearing surrounded by Oaks so huge, their understory
blocks out any rain there may be.  A central place of contact for the Ranger's
Guild, here is where travelers from across the realms meet to discuss the
affairs of the class and its members.    
~
