#38103
The Path of the Range~
   A wide leaf covered path cuts a straight trail through the thick woods here.
These woods are rich with life and magic, and the path is lit from above by
permanent faerie fire spells, a gift from the western Druids.  Other Rangers
nod in your direction in recognition as you pass by.  To the south stands a log
cabin where equipment is provided.    
~
