#38104
Provisions of Survival~
   This small log cabin is stocked from wall to wall with everything a person
could need to survive weeks, even months in the wild.  The main purpose of the
shop is to provide for newer rangers in training however, as Rangers learn to
survive without material aid as they grow more experienced.    
~
