#38105
The Tree Vault~
   You stand in the center of a massive hollowed out tree.  This tree is made
of ironwood, which like its name, is as strong as any metal.  It serves as a
sort of vault for travelling Rangers who place here goods gathered on their
travels for the guild as a whole.  The expectation is that if you take from th
vault, you will contribute to it as much as possible as well.    
~
