The Path of the Range~
   The path continues into the forest, whose foliage thickens at this point.  
So heavy is the understory, that little light filters in through the leaves
above.  To the south stands a massive ironwood tree, an impenetrable vault.  
The territory of the guildmaster lies in the northern part of the forest.    
~
