#38108
The Glade of the Wild~
   The air of this peaceful glade can only be described as perfect tranquility.
No sounds are heard except for a small spring which bubbles from a clear pool
of water.  Animals of many different species sit here calmly, unperterbed by
your prescence.  This is where many rangers go to learn to communicate and
listen to the creatures of the forest.    
~
