The Path of the Range~
   The main path continues to wind through the trees.  The forest is full of
shadows, and your heightened senses tell you that other rangers are nearby,
perhaps practicing the art of camofluage.  To the north is the recovery camp,
where explorers camp to rest up from their travels.    
