#38110
The tannery~
   Along this wooded path you pass a small outpost where the art of tanning,
skinning, and rationing is taught.  It is emphasized that such practices should
only be done when is necessary to the ranger's survival, and that their need
will factor into the fragile balance of nature's many food webs.  Such harmony
with and use of nature is the way of the ranger.    
~
