#38111
The Rite of Challenge~
   It is in this small clearing that challenges are made by those who aspire to
hold the title of Guardian of the Forest, a high rank within the Guild of
Rangers.  A small pedestal and board lie here.  To the north lies the ravine
and shooting range.  To the south lies the path to the tree teleport.    
~
