#38112
The Firing Range~
   A stone trail leads up to a rangers to practice their archery skills.  
Scanning to the north, you see a set of three large archery targets on the
other side of the ravine.  This area also serves as a place of contest for
rangers who wish to settle issues with their bows instead of fists.    
~
