#38113
A Small Ravine~
   A shallow ravine cuts a black stretch through the earth of the forest here.
On one side to the south is the Firing range.  Bolts and arrows fly over your
head to the north where a series of targets have been set up for practice.  
Due to the number of arrows flying through the air, you decide it would not be
very wise to go north and become a dummy yourself.    
~
