#38114
The Recovery Camp~
   A number of well constructed bivouacs stand between the trees here.  The
camp serves as a sort of makeshift hospital for those rangers that need special
healing past their own ability to bind wounds.  A couple druids supervise the
camp, and apply special salves and dressings to those with serious wounds.    
~
